  "title": "Rayonier Reports Second Quarter 2026 Results",
  "summary": "Second quarter net income attributable to Rayonier of $19.1 million (or $0.06 per diluted share), pro forma net income of $31.5 million (or $0.10 per diluted share), and Adjusted EBITDA of $123.7 million. Repurchased $72.4 million of shares at an average price of $20.95 per share. Debt outstanding of $1.86 billion and cash of $411.8 million as of June 30, 2026. Rayonier Inc. (NYSE:RYN) today reported second quarter net income attributable to Rayonier of $19.1 million, or $0.06 per diluted share,",
